title: MilitarPhone
---
Military: A-tten-tion! #line:S2-01-military
Military: In the name of the Catility government. #line:S2-02-military
Military: Our country thanks you for your service! #line:S2-03-military
Military: We have sent a communication device to keep you up to date #line:S2-04-military
Military: With our plans to stop the apocalypse. #line:S2-05-military
Military: Your innovative technique seems to work, so keep at it! #line:S2-06-military
Military: In the meanwhile, or researchers are hard at it looking for a solution. #line:S2-07-military
Military: Good luck! #line:S2-08-military
<<start_wave>>
<<hang_up "military">>
===